At 0.0 seconds: move None
At 6.0 seconds: move (Decimal('1000.40'), None, 'the chase stepped to 1000.40')
At 12.0 seconds: move (Decimal('1000.00'), None, 'the chase ran out of time and crossed to 1000.00')
A sell step to 999.90 with the bid at 1000.00 goes no further than 1000.00
